  m_Name: FeedbackForms_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5ec38919bd39245b98c3ec338c7f7f5e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1
    m_Localized: yew suk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2
    m_Localized: 0 stars sent me to wrong train
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3
    m_Localized: You should shave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4
    m_Localized: You looked cute today... call me if you want a break from trains
      (800) 8135
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5
    m_Localized: xoxo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6
    m_Localized: Do you wear the same thing everyday?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7
    m_Localized: 0 stars, made me pay individually for my 20 krillion children
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8
    m_Localized: "Wish you\u2019d do a little more than stamp my ticket"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9
    m_Localized: Checked my photo for wayyyy too long
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10
    m_Localized: Do you have children... will you adopt mine...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11
    m_Localized: "False advertisement, you aren\u2019t as rugged as they say"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12
    m_Localized: I like my men older ;)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13
    m_Localized: Wanna invest in my side hustle? We could make some big money together
      ;)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14
    m_Localized: Buy ShellCoin now and make 110% back in the next 5 years!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15
    m_Localized: Buy ClawCoin now, and make 68% back in the next 2 years!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16
    m_Localized: You have an outstanding debt of $75,600. Please call (800) 5201
      for a resolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17
    m_Localized: "Why did you break up with me? You can\u2019t do this to me!!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18
    m_Localized: 0 star service, 5 star face card tho
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19
    m_Localized: 0 star looks, 5 star service tho
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20
    m_Localized: "Came to check out the legendary hot manager everyone\u2019s been
      talking about, but you\u2019re really not that impressive tbh"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21
    m_Localized: "Came to check out the legendary hot manager everyone\u2019s been
      talking about. You\u2019re\u2026decent enough. Wanna go out?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22
    m_Localized: AHHHHHH I CANT BELIEVE I MET MY IDOL TODAY HE EVEN PUNCHED MY TICKET
      HIMSELF AAAAAAA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23
    m_Localized: never meet your idols bruh you were so disappointing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24
    m_Localized: Would it be weird if I said that I dreamed of you last night?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25
    m_Localized: "oh\u2026 my savior, the true light of my life\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26
    m_Localized: "The train I took today had really dirty seats, maybe y\u2019all
      could hire some more cleaners?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27
    m_Localized: "The shuttle I took today had really dirty windows, y\u2019all should
      clean more regularly?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28
    m_Localized: 'Great service, would ride again! :D '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29
    m_Localized: Awesome food service, the deluxe ticket was truly worth the price!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30
    m_Localized: "The train attendants were so helpful and kind, they even gave my
      son a free lollipop when he lost his! I can\u2019t thank them enough!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31
    m_Localized: Super kind and helpful! Helped me find the right train when I was
      lost!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32
    m_Localized: help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33
    m_Localized: "they\u2019re coming"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34
    m_Localized: Someday I will make you pay the price for what you did to my family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35
    m_Localized: fishsticks and lobster rolls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36
    m_Localized: "As a frequent commuter, it\u2019s really disappointing how you
      keep letting birds on the train. I\u2019ll be filing a complaint to corporate
      if you don\u2019t make efforts to keep the train safer for us. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37
    m_Localized: "As a frequent commuter, it\u2019s really disappointing how you
      keep letting sea lions on the train. I\u2019ll be filing a complaint to corporate
      if you don\u2019t make efforts to keep the train safer for us. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38
    m_Localized: "I don\u2019t feel safe riding on the train anymore; it just feels
      like I\u2019m surrounded by passengers who want to eat me\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39
    m_Localized: There should be a crustacean-only train
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40
    m_Localized: Terrible service.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41
    m_Localized: Get out while you can!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42
    m_Localized: Stay away from crustacean corp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: "We\u2019re always watching"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: Put a stop to crustacean-ification, stop shuttling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: If you see something, say something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: Too many non-crustaceans on my train
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47
    m_Localized: You looked sad today
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48
    m_Localized: Your family isn't safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49
    m_Localized: I know about your isopod.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50
    m_Localized: You should leave town
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51
    m_Localized: "i ate my lolypop on the train and it disapared\u2026 where did
      it go :("
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52
    m_Localized: mom says samuel is a tardygrad, and urs is an eyesopod!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53
    m_Localized: "mom said she had to tak sameul to the vet, and to not give him
      lolypops anymoar. mister, did i hurt sameul? but i love lolypops\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54
    m_Localized: "mom came back home late agan\u2026 but she bought tuns of lolypops!
      i love my mom so much"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55
    m_Localized: mom said skool is rilly importent, but i dont like it! mister, y
      do i have to go to skool?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56
    m_Localized: 5 stars! No, 6 stars! 100 stars! 1 billion stars! Infinity stars!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57
    m_Localized: mister, when you talk about you and your eyesopod, it makes me so
      happy. will you talk with me more?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58
    m_Localized: "Didn\u2019t let me bring all my plants on board. 0 stars. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59
    m_Localized: They should make the trains more fish-friendly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60
    m_Localized: Not wet enough even though it rained.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61
    m_Localized: "Here\u2019s the address for my next protest\u2026 be discreet.
      \\n1823 Sandy Shore Drive\u2026 Bring duct tape."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62
    m_Localized: "Lad, I must thank you for listening to this old soul\u2019s ramblings."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63
    m_Localized: "Do you wish to hear tales of old? It is rare for one like you to
      be willing to listen to\u2026 an old fool."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64
    m_Localized: "Though one\u2019s compatriots no longer walk the same path, the
      currents and the soil still whisper their voices, as they call one to the other
      shore. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65
    m_Localized: "In ages past, we swam from claws that stretched from the abyss
      and maws that could swallow us whole. Still, one must correct one\u2019s words.
      Those claws and maws have vanished from the tangible world, but they still
      live within our hearts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66
    m_Localized: "Does one know how to do a \u201Csick wheelie\u201D? \u2026Of course
      one once did, one is just an old geezer with arthritis now alright?!?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67
    m_Localized: "The sea scorpions are gone, but so are one\u2019s closest companions\u2026
      Coral, Pearl, Finn, where are you all now?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 68
    m_Localized: "By the time one found the scorpion cave, all that was left was
      their exoskeletons. Had one not abandoned them that day\u2026maybe one wouldn\u2019t
      be so alone right now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69
    m_Localized: "One personally believes those cold corporate reefs are not so different
      from those scorpion caves. It is just that a different predator lurks in the
      shadows\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70
    m_Localized: "One should have skipped training more often and watched their performances.
      Young lad, don\u2019t waste your life away at this kiosk, especially for an
      ungrateful power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71
    m_Localized: "My memories\u2026 Pearl used to dance as a side job at the nearby
      atoll, and Coral played the tubes in the sea symphony. Finn\u2019s claw-to-claw
      combat was uncontested\u2026 but he and his sand paintings were more beautiful.
      Make sure to treasure the ones you love."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72
    m_Localized: "Young lad, do not weep for me. This was a fate long destined that
      I had run away from for far too long. Since you have heard this sinner\u2019s
      confessions, you know that I must atone for my sins. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73
    m_Localized: I woke up from a beautiful dream this morn. There were no bleached
      corals, but old reefs and familiar faces calling me. Therefore, I shall depart
      for the other shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74
    m_Localized: Nice guy, but refuses to buy matching bows with me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75
    m_Localized: "The train was too loud I couldn\u2019t read. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76
    m_Localized: "Didn\u2019t tell me my voice was too quiet which was great"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77
    m_Localized: Awesome kiddo, reminds me of my own kids a lot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 78
    m_Localized: "Dressed well, nice manners, hardworking\u2026 I hope my kids become
      someone like you when they grow up"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79
    m_Localized: "Great service, just\u2026 the ticket prices are a bit high. You
      don\u2019t think you could put a word in with management to get these tickets
      priced a lil lower?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80
    m_Localized: "Honestly, my husband keeps mentioning you as a good kid whenever
      he gets back home. You think you could give him a small hint to bring less
      flowers back? I really love his big dumb heart, but there\u2019s no space at
      home anymore!!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81
    m_Localized: "How about this one\u2026 how does seaweed answer the phone? \u201CHello,
      how can I kelp you?\u201D Haha! Funny, right? (give me a 5 star rating on this
      joke and I\u2019ll give you a 5 star rating on the customer service platform"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82
    m_Localized: 'When you see gramps next can you make sure to give him a good seat? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83
    m_Localized: Listens, but never answers my questions. Could be more polite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84
    m_Localized: "Very handsome, but won\u2019t date my granddaughter."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85
    m_Localized: Wears the same thing every day, should get some new clothes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86
    m_Localized: Could use a new pocket square, looks a little dusty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87
    m_Localized: Good firm handshake, handsome young fella.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88
    m_Localized: Always listens to me. I love this guy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89
    m_Localized: "If you ever need some particular wisdom, here\u2019s my number.
      I\u2019ve got lots of it. 921-8564"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
